{"4299510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mr. Nice Guy", "steam_appid": 4299510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4814230], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/2206aeb1dceff57b3ede58945a959c47.poster.avif?t=1781475001\" width=426 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/2206aeb1dceff57b3ede58945a959c47.webm?t=1781475001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/2206aeb1dceff57b3ede58945a959c47.mp4?t=1781475001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">=========</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;Eternal Smiles Hospital&quot; was the last place I wanted to see again. It’s been abandoned for nearly a decade, and a lot more than spiders now lurk in its halls. But here I am. I have no other choice.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>It was here, ten years ago, that I was miraculously cured. I escaped these eerie rooms that day... and I escaped <strong>him</strong>. I guess I messed up all his plans. The hospital’s founder may be dead now, but he’s never stopped hunting me. I was the one who got away. But I’m not a kid any more... and he needs a kid.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>So if he couldn't have me, he took the next best thing... my brother.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Alex went missing two days ago. And I have a feeling he's here, at &quot;Eternal Smiles Hospital&quot;… with <strong>him</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">=========</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/856dc7656f1a8962b37756f970d63555.poster.avif?t=1781475001\" width=426 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/856dc7656f1a8962b37756f970d63555.webm?t=1781475001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/856dc7656f1a8962b37756f970d63555.mp4?t=1781475001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as the Final Girl:</strong> Explore an abandoned hospital and escape mysterious supernatural forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detect Anomalies:</strong> Use cameras and monitors to discover anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a mystery:</strong> search for your missing brother and discover the unsettling truth behind Eternal Smiles Hospital.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play endlessly:</strong> Choose from story mode or the never ending Eternal mode with randomized rooms and corridors that never end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lock picking mini game:</strong> Find Bobby pins to pick locks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crunchy Lo-Fi Visuals:</strong> Choose between PSX style crunchy graphics or higher fidelity rendering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Score:</strong> No horror game would be complete without a killer original soundtrack (100% human made).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixed Cameras:</strong> Re-live the golden age of survival horror classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank Controls</strong> (optional): Navigate tense environments with classic control schemes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/48ccb04f743566e410e98db3bde30983.poster.avif?t=1781475001\" width=426 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/48ccb04f743566e410e98db3bde30983.webm?t=1781475001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/48ccb04f743566e410e98db3bde30983.mp4?t=1781475001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/2206aeb1dceff57b3ede58945a959c47.poster.avif?t=1781475001\" width=426 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/2206aeb1dceff57b3ede58945a959c47.webm?t=1781475001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4299510/extras/2206aeb1dceff57b3ede58945a959c47.mp4?t=1781475001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\